{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港仔發現浮屍。今日（27日）下午3時許，警方接獲途人報案，發現一名男子在瀑布灣道一個石灘岸邊漂浮，救護員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列作「屍體發現」處理。</p><p>據了解，事主為80歲梁姓老翁。</p><figure><img alt=\"案發香港仔瀑布灣道一個石灘。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1191941777263693824659031.jpeg/K0O3AGFQ1j3DWOsHVlOJbQxFSK-YZt3irJ03TKydN0w\"/><figcaption>案發香港仔瀑布灣道一個石灘。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T19:00:27.586663+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:12:17.398009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:29.384088+00:00","content_hash":"0dc846b5b31908330c19ab55ca160ce2a2f95f513b6065a0fcd05e94a7cb8d93","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}